				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				100,
				3
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Rest): Migrate to OXC 0.127 API for codegen and transform\n\nUpdate Rest to work with OXC 0.127's restructured APIs. The old flat `comments: bool` in CodegenOptions is replaced by a structured CommentOptions type supporting separate control over normal, jsdoc, annotation, and legal comments. Map legacy boolean to the two extremes for backward compatibility.\n\nFor transformer, replace the deprecated `into_symbol_table_and_scope_tree()` / `build_with_symbols_and_scopes()` (OXC 0.48-era API) with the new unified `into_scoping()` / `build_with_scoping()` which returns a single Scoping value.\n\nThe binary is regenerated to include these changes.",
			"SHA": "f0ddbf967b258124d1555d5c98e4809d74cb91fe"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-22T18:48:46Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				100,
				1
			],
			"Message": "build(Rest): Update rayon from 1.11.0 to 1.12.0\n\nBump the rayon dependency version in Cargo.toml from 1.11.0 to 1.12.0. This pulls in upstream performance improvements and bug fixes from the rayon parallel iterator library.",
			"SHA": "f4d5f52610e868172ef4057f4fd6a83f80410e20"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-22T14:20:45Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				100,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Rest): Normalize CHANGELOG version header formatting\n\nReplace em dashes (—) with hyphens (-) in version section headers and list item separators throughout the CHANGELOG for consistent Markdown rendering.\n\nChanges affect all version headers from v2.1 through v0.1, standardizing the format from `## [v2.1] — Q2 2026:` to `## [v2.1] - Q2 2026:`.",
			"SHA": "fcf882d813d1d6fefe4014c5e8308f25696dca01"
